PokemonMansion_SecretLab_Text_WallFeelsHollow::
    .string "The wall sounds hollow here…$"

PokemonMansion_SecretLab_Text_HiddenDoorOpen::
    .string "A hidden door in the wall is ajar.\n"
    .string "It wasn't open before…\p"
    .string "Go inside?$"

PokemonMansion_SecretLab_Text_Log1::
    .string "It's a lab log.\p"
    .string "“July 20. Subject M-1, grown from\n"
    .string "the cells of MEW, has awakened.\p"
    .string "It could not keep a shape of its\n"
    .string "own and slumped into a pink mass.”$"

PokemonMansion_SecretLab_Text_Log2::
    .string "It's a lab log.\p"
    .string "“August 3. M-1 turned into the\n"
    .string "RATTATA we fed it, then into me.\p"
    .string "It can copy anything it sees, just\n"
    .string "as MEW is said to know every move.\p"
    .string "Yet it has no power of its own.\n"
    .string "Is this what we set out to make?”$"

PokemonMansion_SecretLab_Text_Log3::
    .string "It's a lab log.\p"
    .string "“August 29. All effort now goes\n"
    .string "into Subject M-2.\p"
    .string "M-1 stays sealed in its capsule.\p"
    .string "…The DITTO caught out on the\n"
    .string "routes look awfully similar.\l"
    .string "Surely it's a coincidence.”$"

PokemonMansion_SecretLab_Text_PinkMassWriggling::
    .string "A pink mass is wriggling inside the\n"
    .string "culture capsule…$"

PokemonMansion_SecretLab_Text_ItStaredAtYou::
    .string "It pressed against the glass and\n"
    .string "stared at {PLAYER}…\p"
    .string "The capsule cracked open!$"

PokemonMansion_SecretLab_Text_CapsuleEmpty::
    .string "The culture capsule is cracked\n"
    .string "and empty.$"
